    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just going through the motions lately. everything is just... empty. huge meetings, making decisions that cost millions, all this pressure, but none of it actually matters. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person looking back. it's just a shell. i'm just so tired of pretending i care about any of this.",
